OL,3,GNEWSATrain derailment carriages moved
OL,4,Aamid track probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun on removing the
OL,7,Fcarriages of the train that derailed
OL,8,Fnear Lewes with 150 people on board.
OL,10,FThirty people were injured, two
OL,11,Fseriously, when the Southern 14:24 BST
OL,12,Fservice from London Victoria to
OL,13,FEastbourne came off the tracks last
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FVideo posted on social media, external
OL,17,Fshowed carriages that did not derail
OL,18,Fbeing transported through Lewes station
OL,19,Fovernight, as recovery work continues
OL,20,Fat the site.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
