OL,3,GNEWSATrain derailment carriages moved
OL,4,Aamid track probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA preliminary report by the Rail
OL,7,FAccident Investigation Branch (RAIB)
OL,8,Ffound a defect in the track where the
OL,9,Ftrain derailed. Network Rail and
OL,10,FGreater Thameslink Railway (GTR), which
OL,11,Fruns Southern, have said they will
OL,12,Fconsider recommendations from the
OL,13,Finvestigation and work to implement
OL,14,Fthem.
